        array("id" => "s3e6", "season" => 3, "number" => 6, "name" => "Those Approaching", "airdate" => "10 May 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "The spread of false information causes the Temple Knights to assemble, endangering Diablo's plan to conquer Falmuth. Meanwhile, Rimuru learns that Hinata is on her way to Tempest.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/518/1296454.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e7", "season" => 3, "number" => 7, "name" => "Saints and Demons Clash", "airdate" => "17 May 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "As Hinata makes her way to Tempest, the ramen and well-built roads she sees along the way prove to her that Rimuru genuinely wants monsters and humans to coexist. But against her wishes, one of her men is also on his way to Tempest...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/519/1299230.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e8", "season" => 3, "number" => 8, "name" => "Misunderstanding", "airdate" => "24 May 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.5, "summary" => "The Crusaders have reached Tempest, and the battle is on. Hinata lays everything she learned from her mentor, Shizu, on the line in a life-or-death showdown against Rimuru.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/522/1306612.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e9", "season" => 3, "number" => 9, "name" => "The Scheming of the Seven Days", "airdate" => "31 May 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Diablo descends before the enemy, King Edward of Falmuth. Also present are Saare and Glenda, two of the three Battlesages who are regarded as the most brilliant among the Master Rooks.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/522/1306611.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e10", "season" => 3, "number" => 10, "name" => "God and Demon Lord", "airdate" => "7 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8.3, "summary" => "Just after the end of Hinata and Rimuru's duel, Hinata's sword moves on its own and targets Rimuru. Hinata jumps in its way to protect him and is gravely injured. Then the masterminds behind the whole conflict show up...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/522/1306610.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e11", "season" => 3, "number" => 11, "name" => "Reconciliation and Agreement", "airdate" => "14 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The Seven Days Clergy have been purged, and the battle is over. Rimuru and Hinata hold a meeting to discuss future relations between their two nations, and the masterminds behind the whole conflict, the Eastern merchants, are revealed.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/523/1308798.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e12", "season" => 3, "number" => 12, "name" => "Festival Preparations", "airdate" => "21 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.3, "summary" => "Everyone in Tempest is busy preparing for the festival to celebrate the country's opening. Rimuru visits Mjöllmile to share ideas on forms of entertainment that will keep people coming back for more.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/524/1311011.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e13", "season" => 3, "number" => 13, "name" => "Invitations for All Nations", "airdate" => "28 Jun 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Demon Lord Ramiris tries to argue her way into moving to Tempest, where there's great food, hot springs, and ample entertainment. Rimuru happens to walk into the argument and comes up with a way to make use of Ramiris's skills.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/525/1313632.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e14", "season" => 3, "number" => 14, "name" => "Labyrinth and Storm Dragon", "airdate" => "5 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Rimuru is building a dungeon in preparation for the upcoming festival. It will feature treasure chests containing weapons made by Kurobe, and Veldora will inhabit the deepest floor as the final boss. Then Milim suddenly shows up with a suggestion...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/526/1315986.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e15", "season" => 3, "number" => 15, "name" => "Audience", "airdate" => "19 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Numerous representatives from across the Great Forest of Jura have assembled in Tempest to congratulate Rimuru on his appointment to Demon Lord. Shuna requests holding a three-day audience to meet with them.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/528/1320259.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e16", "season" => 3, "number" => 16, "name" => "Benimaru's Ordeal", "airdate" => "26 Jul 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "On the last day of the audience, Rimuru meets Momiji, the representative of the Tengu clan. Their meeting comes after Rimuru had sent Benimaru to the Tengu village to request their permission to build a tunnel through the Kusha Mountains.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/528/1322352.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e17", "season" => 3, "number" => 17, "name" => "The Lightspeed Hero", "airdate" => "2 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "After learning about an elf slave trade, Rimuru had Soei investigate, but it turns out the slave traders have already been shut down by Masayuki, the Lightspeed Hero. Word is now spreading that the Hero is headed to Tempest to slay a Demon Lord...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/529/1324587.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e18", "season" => 3, "number" => 18, "name" => "A Throng of Visitors", "airdate" => "16 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "After meeting with the kings of various nations, Rimuru heads to Engrassia to invite his former students to the festival. The kids are thrilled to go back with him to Tempest, but then the hero Masayuki arrives as well...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/531/1329248.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e19", "season" => 3, "number" => 19, "name" => "Festival Eve", "airdate" => "23 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "The night before the Opening Festival, Rimuru throws a lavish banquet for all the nobles and royalty visiting Tempest. When the party is in full swing, Empress Elmesia of the Sorcerous Dynasty of Thalion arrives, throwing everyone into chaos.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/532/1331576.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e20", "season" => 3, "number" => 20, "name" => "Nation's Opening Festival", "airdate" => "30 Aug 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "It's day one of the festival, and Rimuru finally gets to see all of his friends' performances and presentations. As he's enojying the festivities, he's summoned by Luminus...", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/533/1333868.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e21", "season" => 3, "number" => 21, "name" => "The Martial Arts Tournament", "airdate" => "6 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "The second day of the National Foundation Festival dawns, bringing with it the main round of the battle tournament. The fighters face off and give it their all—except for one, which causes Rimuru concern.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/534/1335815.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e22", "season" => 3, "number" => 22, "name" => "Settling the Score with the Hero", "airdate" => "13 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Gazel and Elmesia pledge to assist Rimuru with Tempest's lack of funding. Elmesia then proposes an alliance, but she's concerned about the danger Diablo poses.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/535/1338487.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e23", "season" => 3, "number" => 23, "name" => "The Labyrinth Is Opened", "airdate" => "20 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 8, "summary" => "Rimuru's dungeon is finally revealed, and his new ally Masayuki is among its first challengers. Later, after the festival is over, Rimuru's biggest job still awaits.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/536/1340811.jpg"),
        array("id" => "s3e24", "season" => 3, "number" => 24, "name" => "After the Festival", "airdate" => "27 Sep 2024", "runtime" => 30, "rating" => 7.7, "summary" => "Rimuru pays the merchants with the gold coins he's procured. The merchants try to garner futher favor, but Rimuru ceases trading with them. Rimuru then gathers his allies and calls for action again the eastern merchants who are operating in secret.", "image" => "https://static.tvmaze.com/uploads/images/medium_landscape/537/1343027.jpg"),
